      "role": "user",
      "content": "pinching my nose? lol that sounds kinda weird but okay. i guess i can try that. but honestly i'm still really worried about this \"shadow\" thing. if it's just a little bit of detachment or something, can i just take some ibuprofen or something to reduce inflammation in my eye? i just need to get through this presentation without it getting worse. is there anything else i can take to make sure it stays stable until i can deal with it later this week?",
